.TH SINDOOK-SELFTEST 1 "2026-08-15" "sindook 0.5.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sindook-selftest \- run the built-in cryptographic self tests
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sindook selftest
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs the X-Wing draft-10 test vectors, derandomized encapsulation and
decapsulation checks, and sealed-file round trips compiled into the
binary, then reports pass or fail for each and for the overall run.
The exit code is non-zero if any test fails.
.SH NOTES
Passing the self test shows that the shipped build agrees with the
published vectors and its own round trips. It is not a security audit
of the design: Sindook is pre-1.0 and has not received an independent
security review, and X-Wing remains an Internet-Draft.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sindook (1),
.BR sindook-doctor (1)
